You know how to protect yourself with the deepest shadows. As long as you stand on an unlit tile you gain [30, 30, 30, 37, 50 (CON 10-100)] armour, 50% armour hardiness, and 20% evasion.

Any time you deal darkness damage, you will unlight both the target tile and yours.

Passively increases your stealth rating by 30.

The armor bonus scales with your Constitution.
